le situations\n- Rival stars are healthy for the most part: the top team (jnally8) has Chris Olave Questionable (hamstring); Girthenheimer's DJ Moore is Out (shoulder). Neither changes your trade plans yet.\n- Waiver competition is light: everyone still has a full $200, so early premium bids can be won by matching, not overpaying.\n\n## Bottom line (3 bullets max)\n- Start your engine lineup as is; no injury changes to it.\n- Bid $25 on Goedert (would start at flex), and consider $11 on Singletary only as depth.\n- Watch Murray's clearance on Sunday; no action needed for you either way.\n",
